  "_comment": [
    "Songs the congregation sings that the app cannot print the words to yet.",
    "",
    "These become index-only entries: title, writer, and where the song is found,",
    "with no lyrics. A song title is a fact and carries no copyright, so listing",
    "one is free and unambiguously legal — and it answers the question people",
    "actually ask mid-service, which is 'what number is that?'",
    "",
    "status 'copyright' means the writer and date are known and the work is still",
    "in copyright. status 'unknown' means nobody has identified it yet — those are",
    "from the camp songbooks, which print no copyright lines at all.",
    "",
    "When permission arrives for one, delete its entry here and add a real file in",
    "songs/ instead. Nothing else needs changing."
